OL,3,GNEWSAEight arrested after men fought
OL,4,Awith bats and poles
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police officers have been
OL,7,Fdeployed in St Helens after eight men
OL,8,Fwere arrested following a mass brawl.
OL,10,FMerseyside Police said a group armed
OL,11,Fwith poles and bats were seen fighting
OL,12,Fon St Helens Linkway on Thursday.
OL,14,FSix men aged between 15 and 19 were
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of affray and
OL,16,Fpossession of offensive weapons in a
OL,17,Fpublic place, while two others - aged
OL,18,F18 and 22 - were detained on suspicion
OL,19,Fof affray.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
