OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal zone remains in place until
OL,7,F14:00 BST on Sunday, enabling police to
OL,8,Forder members of the public to leave
OL,9,Fthe area and not return for 48 hours.
OL,10,FThose who fail to comply face arrest.
